</edge>
<edge source="Ferdinand de Lesseps" target="Yellow Fever">
  <data key="d5">["USED_FOR"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Yellow Fever was a problem that hindered the construction of the Panama Canal.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Tropical diseases, especially yellow fever and malaria, killed thousands of workers.", "chunk_id": "11244e0939bd5300", "doc_id": "hp_b81c660e7e08cae6", "type": "USED_FOR"}]</data>
